            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "Good afternoon. Today I will explain how jaggery is made on our farm."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "First, the sugarcane is harvested in winter, when it is sweet."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "Then the canes are cleaned and crushed in a machine."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "The juice is collected in big containers."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "Next, the juice is boiled in a wide iron pan for about three hours."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "The dirt on top is removed with a big spoon."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "When the juice becomes thick and golden, it is poured into moulds."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "Finally, the jaggery is cooled, packed and sold at the market."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Papa",
              "pic": "👨‍🌾",
              "en": "Nothing is wasted. The dry canes are used as fuel for the fire."
            }
          ]
